# Admin Management Module

This branch contains the **Administration Management** functionality of the Web-Based Banking System.

## Overview

The Admin Management module provides administrative features required to monitor and manage the banking system through a centralized admin interface.

## Main Features

- Admin Dashboard
- View and manage system records
- Review submitted information
- Update administrative records
- Monitor system activities
- Manage relevant user/account information
- Control administrative operations
- View system-related details and statuses

## Admin Responsibilities

The Administrator is responsible for supervising and maintaining the system by reviewing information, updating records, monitoring activities, and performing required management operations.

## Technologies Used

- Java
- Java Servlets
- JSP
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- MySQL
- Maven
- Apache Tomcat

## Project Structure

The Admin Management implementation follows the project architecture using:

- **Controller Layer** – Handles admin requests and responses
- **DAO Layer** – Handles database operations
- **Model Layer** – Represents system data
- **View Layer** – Provides the Admin user interface

## Purpose

The main purpose of this module is to provide administrators with a secure and organized way to manage important banking system operations from a centralized interface.

## Branch

`feature/admin-management`

---

**Developed as part of the Web-Based Banking System group project.**
